=== Q1: Lesson lifecycle ===
--- Q1: LEARNING_POLICY ---
policy: LEARNING_POLICY
version: 1.0.0
lesson_scopes: [PROJECT, PRODUCT, FRAMEWORK]
lesson_lifecycle: [candidate, corroborated, classified, proposed, validated, approved, promoted, rejected]
corroboration_min_sources: 1
upstream_eligible_scopes: [FRAMEWORK]
upstream:
  approval: human                     # human | policy
  allowed_payload: [packet, synthetic_fixture]
  aggregate_metrics_enabled: false
  forbidden_paths: ["product/**", "spec/**", ".governance-runtime/**", "governance/project/**", "archive/**", "**/.env*", "**/*.db", "**/*.sqlite*"]
  forbidden_content: [secrets, customer_identifiers, project_identifiers, raw_product_code, raw_spec, vector_index]
  max_code_lines_unless_synthetic: 0
  ledger: spec/reports/upstream-ledger.jsonl
release_triggers:
  critical_defect: immediate_patch_candidate
  cross_project_repeat: strong_change_candidate
  repeated_low_level: batched_minor_release

--- Q1: Create a lesson record ---
 create mode 100644 spec/audits/AUD-0002.yaml
 create mode 100644 spec/reports/LSN-0001.yaml

--- Q2: Decision vs lesson ---
Decisions are stored as records of type 'decision' with state_class AUTHORITATIVE.
Lessons are type 'lesson' with state_class EVIDENCE.
Decisions record chosen action; lessons record evidence.
5:state_class: EVIDENCE

--- Q3: FRAMEWORK scope eligible for upstream ---
upstream_eligible_scopes from LEARNING_POLICY:
upstream_eligible_scopes: [FRAMEWORK]

